# Setup
DoliCurateSetup = Doli Curate setup
DoliCurateSetupIntro = Doli Curate adds screens for organising the product catalogue: a bulk assign worklist, re-runnable tagging rules, category tree management, and a coverage dashboard. Every membership change is recorded and can be undone.
PageSize = Worklist page size
PageSizeDesc = Products shown per page on the assign screen.
PreviewLimit = Preview limit
PreviewLimitDesc = Maximum rows shown when previewing a rule. Higher values make previews slower on large catalogues.
BatchLimit = Batch limit
BatchLimitDesc = Maximum membership changes allowed in a single operation. Guards against a mistyped rule rewriting the whole catalogue.
ShowImages = Show thumbnails
ShowImagesDesc = Show product photos in the worklist. Slower on large catalogues.
KeepLogDays = Keep history for
KeepLogDaysDesc = Days of change history to retain. Older entries can no longer be undone.
DebugMode = Debug mode
DebugModeDesc = When enabled, exposes a diagnostic endpoint at /custom/dolicurate/ajax/debug.php.

